                <pb facs="0528" n="408" xml:id="pg408"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Dawson to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-12-03"><hi rendition="#italic">December 3,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Vice-President has arrived at call Horacista Cabinet ministers. The public fears
                    rupture between him and the President. At the request of both, I will be present
                    at conference. If the Vice-President and his faction, who control military,
                    should imprison, drive from capital, force resignation * * * of the President,
                    am I authorized to ask admiral to land forces to protect American citizens and
                    preserve order? No constitutional recognized government would exist to ask
                    American assistance as indicated in your telegram of the 8th November.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dawson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
